        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Passage Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a wide Escutcheon Plate Passage Function Lever (Entry by Outside lever - Always unlocked)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. Old Item# PDQ-629LPENFH\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/wide-escutcheon-plate-classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-ew-08-phl\"><b>Classroom Function Lever for 6200 Series Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/wide-escutcheon-plate-night-latch-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-ew-09-phl\"><b>Night Latch Function Lever for 6200 Series Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware and instructions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 6-EW-14-PHL Passage Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage Function (ANSI F14) - Entry by Outside lever - Always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 8-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
